# The web app needs no environment variable.
# It always calls the API on its own origin (/api/...): Vercel rewrites /api/* to the
# Railway service (vercel.json), Railway serves the built app itself, and `bun run dev`
# proxies /api to the local API on http://localhost:3000 (vite.config.ts).
# There is no API URL setting: the session cookie (__Host-, SameSite=Strict) and the
# relative photo URLs only work on the same origin.
